 the first bread she's had in years, but there's a problem...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yWj4kPKRQJ0f3QfBc09FvGL6Yw1.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"76579","synopsis":"Femicia lives with her loving family. She's about to turn five—the age at which everyone receives a magical skill. No one knows what skill they will receive. That is left to the will of the gods. Femicia wants to be a tamer and work with monsters, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/830WMp6257OFhsVqQLjBY85Sf4C.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"76752","synopsis":"Ivy and Sora continue their journey, enjoying their time together. In an attempt to get Sora to sleep early, Ivy begins to tell a bedtime story. Long, long ago, the world was at war. To stop the war, a magician used a certain magic...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6kMGUtmtGyOOJV50JGtZigFiIRF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"76905","synopsis":"At the entrance to the next village, Ivy spots a scary-looking guard standing watch. Trembling with fear, she attempts to pass, but the guard stops and questions her. When she says that she's come from Latomi Village, the guard says something unexpected.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6lk8WIkQOM4ERKsPLvJXGGUZbTR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"77101","synopsis":"When Ivy goes into the village to sell her catch, everyone is really nice to her which makes her nervous. Later, she chances upon a peddler selling zaro, a specialty of Latomi Village. When she asks how the village is faring, the answer surprises her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mbIwF8lpanG24Hto8YeyQmtFONk.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77327","synopsis":"Ivy, Sora, and Ciel continue their travels. Suddenly, something starts chasing them! Ivy manages to get away, but runs into a horde of monsters! As Ivy tries to escape, she gets caught in a trap and can't move! Then a team of adventurers appears!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgOzR2QVlUYqN3M5lAqcfdldzdH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77760","synopsis":"Ivy's delicious cooking has made her very popular. The suppression squad feasts after a job well done and the next day, they set out for Otolwa with Ivy. She's deeply impressed by her first sight of a big town, but it hides a serious problem.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lUWRS4pJwclug86baMzsKiHLPhG.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"77906","synopsis":"When Ivy says that she's just turned nine, everyone congratulates her. Ivy is deeply moved by their well wishes. The members of Blazing Sword and Lighting King explain the organization's crimes and Ivy offers analysis, with Sora and her past life's help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8z5XAAX4Gh0PnToWAwBiUCRjG9I.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"78087","synopsis":"Ivy and Lattrua go to eat sweets with Meela and her brothers. According to Sora, the twins Tolto and Malma were bad people after all. Suspecting that Green Gale is a decoy for the organization, Ivy decides to be the bait in a trap.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9bLH3f5cJGNs8ZqkLn1rSxpXbs7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"427066","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"78220","synopsis":"Ivy and Lattrua begin the operation. The two pretend to be caught in a trap and arrive at the sweet shop where the enemy is located, along with the Green Gale. There, Lattrua questions Meela and the others. With their identities revealed, Tolto and Malma choose to fight Lattrua. Meanwhile, Flaming Sword and Thunder King are carrying out another operation with Captain Burksby.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z5gvExTlc5MJKNC0vf6ULk8gGhy.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17712","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"156891","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53590","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"214310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider